			<br />
			<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please see below details of an <span style="font-family:Arial Black,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">AWB </span>that requires action. We have provided all the key information Along with what we have already investigated. Could you refer to the&nbsp;<b>Action Required</b> section and provide CSU a response.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
